title: The outgoing calls and implementations a language server gives take the place of the ones guessed by name
folders: rust-small
extensions: relations-extension
expect-log: exact outgoing calls of 'main': 1
expect-log: exact implementations of 'main': 1
forbid-log: exact uses of

wait 4000
right symbols
select main
wait 2500
locate
wait 1200
mark exact-calls
wait 800
quit
